; c02-opponent-double-five. Anchor: shot-0027 (Ch. 2, Hand 3).
; Printed: 2/3 (two to one).
; Claim: an opponent holds the double-five.
; State: Hand 3, fours trump (5-2 4-1 6-6 6-4 4-2 4-3 4-4), nothing played;
;   the 21 others dealt uniformly, seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 2/3. Book model: 2/3.
(query (roles (chair v) (chair x))
  (out)
  (pattern
    (viewer v)
    (opponent v x)
    (holds x 5-5)))
